{"sha": "6b72a698ca76bbe32034bcd11669630d0f1e3438e11cb53ce29de72ea0baaf40", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:seq} 章 --- 数列初步}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:1}", "$u_n = \\frac{n}{n+1}$: $u_1 = \\frac12$, $u_2 = \\frac23$,", "$u_3 = \\frac34$.", "", "$u_0 = 5$, $u_{n+1} = 3u_n - 2$: $u_1 = 13$, $u_2 = 37$, $u_3 = 109$.", "", "$u_n = (-1)^n n$: $u_1 = -1$, $u_2 = 2$, $u_3 = -3$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:2}", "$u_{10} = 7 + 10 \\times (-3) = -23$ 且 $u_{25} = 7 - 75 = -68$。", "", "对于 $(v_n)$：由 $v_8 = v_3 + 5d$ 得 $26 = 11 + 5d$，所以 $d = 3$；", "再得 $v_0 = v_3 - 3d = 11 - 9 = 2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:3}", "$u_8 = 5 \\times 2^8 = 1280$.", "", "对于 $(v_n)$：由 $v_4 = v_2\\, q^2$ 得 $48 = 12 q^2$，故 $q^2 = 4$，且", "$q = 2$（各项为正）。于是", "$v_0 = \\frac{v_2}{q^2} = \\frac{12}{4} = 3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:4}", "$1 + \\dots + 500 = \\frac{500 \\times 501}{2} = 125\\,250$.", "", "$4 + 7 + \\dots + 61$ 为等差数列，公差 $d = 3$，且", "共 $\\frac{61 - 4}{3} + 1 = 20$ 项，其和为", "$20 \\times \\frac{4 + 61}{2} = 650$.", "", "$1 + \\frac12 + \\dots + \\frac{1}{2^{10}}$ 为等比数列，公比 $q = \\frac12$，", "共 $11$ 项，其和为：", "$\\frac{1 - (1/2)^{11}}{1 - 1/2} = 2\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2048}\\right)", "= \\frac{2047}{1024}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:5}", "$u_{n+1} - u_n = 4(n+1) - 1 - 4n + 1 = 4$：为等差数列，公差 $d = 4$。", "", "$\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n} = \\frac{2^{n+1}}{3^{n+2}} \\cdot \\frac{3^{n+1}}{2^n}", "= \\frac23$：为等比数列，公比 $q = \\frac23$。", "", "$w_0 = 0$，$w_1 = 2$，$w_2 = 6$：相邻两项之差 $2$ 与 $4$ 不相等，", "故非等差数列；$\\frac{w_1}{w_0}$ 无定义，且", "比值 $\\frac{w_2}{w_1} = 3 \\neq \\frac{w_3}{w_2} = 2$，故亦非等比数列。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:6}", "各排座位数成等差数列，首项 $16$，公差 $2$。最后", "一排（第 20 排）有 $16 + 19 \\times 2 = 54$ 个座位。", "共 $20 \\times \\frac{16 + 54}{2} = 700$ 个座位。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:7}", "经过 $n$ 小时后，细菌数为 $500 \\times 2^n$。晚上 8 点时，$n = 8$：", "此时细菌有 $500 \\times 256 = 128\\,000$ 个。需满足 $500 \\times 2^n >", "10^6$，即 $2^n > 2000$：由于 $2^{10} = 1024$ 且 $2^{11} = 2048$，", "细菌数首次超过一百万，是在经过 $11$ 个整小时后，即晚上 11 点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:8}", "$c_2 = 1.002 \\times 100 + 100 = 200.20$，且", "$c_3 = 1.002 \\times 200.20 + 100 \\approx 300.60$。相邻两项之差", "$c_2 - c_1 = 100.20$ 与 $c_3 - c_2 \\approx 100.40$ 不相等，故", "$(c_n)$ 不是等差数列；比值 $\\frac{c_2}{c_1} = 2.002$ 与", "$\\frac{c_3}{c_2} \\approx 1.50$ 亦不相等，故非等比数列。（此类“先乘后加”形式的", "混合递推，可借辅助数列技巧求解，", "见\\cref{exo:g11:seq:11}。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:9}", "$u_{n+1} - u_n = (n+1)^2 - 8(n+1) - n^2 + 8n = 2n - 7$：当", "$n \\leq 3$ 时为负，$n \\geq 4$ 时为正。因此 $(u_n)$ 先递减，直至", "$u_4 = 16 - 32 = -16$，之后递增，故该数列不单调。", "", "$(v_n)$ 各项为正，且", "\\[", "\\frac{v_{n+1}}{v_n} = \\frac{3^{n+1}}{(n+1)!} \\cdot \\frac{n!}{3^n}", "= \\frac{3}{n+1},", "\\]", "该比值 $> 1$（当 $n \\leq 1$ 时），$= 1$（$n = 2$ 时），且", "$< 1$（$n \\geq 3$ 时），故数列先递增至 $v_2 = v_3 = \\frac92$，然后", "递减。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:10}", "前 $n$ 项为 $u_0, \\dots, u_{n-1}$，其中 $u_0 = 3$，且", "$u_{n-1} = 3 + 4(n-1) = 4n - 1$。它们的和为", "\\[", "n \\times \\frac{3 + (4n-1)}{2} = n(2n + 1) = 903,", "\\]", "故 $2n^2 + n - 903 = 0$。此时 $\\Delta = 1 + 4 \\times 2 \\times 903 =", "7225 = 85^2$，且 $n = \\frac{-1 + 85}{4} = 21$（负根", "舍去）。检验：$21 \\times 43 = 903$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:seq:11}", "\\emph{1.} $u_1 = 5$，$u_2 = 9$，$u_3 = 17$：每一项都比", "$4, 8, 16$ 多 1，由此推测 $u_n = 2^{n+1} + 1$。", "", "\\emph{2.} 令 $v_n = u_n - 1$：", "\\[", "v_{n+1} = u_{n+1} - 1 = 2u_n - 1 - 1 = 2(u_n - 1) = 2v_n,", "\\]", "故 $(v_n)$ 为等比数列，公比为 $2$，", "首项为 $v_0 = u_0 - 1 = 2$。", ""]}